# HTTP Cat API Tests

Automated tests for https://http.cat validating HTTP responses and HTML content.

The project verifies HTTP status codes, response headers, and basic HTML structure returned by the service.

## Tech Stack

- Python 3.11
- Pytest
- Requests
- BeautifulSoup4

## Project Structure

- `clients/` – API client layer
- `utils/` – helper functions (HTML parsing)
- `tests/` – test cases

## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt